{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "digieq",
 "version": "1.1",
 "title": "Digi EQ",
 "description": "A master tone tilt: the output split into low and high bands, each with its own 0..127 gain (centre 64 = flat, stock scale, one step per notch). A gentle upward tilt by default (low 33, high 111); the knobbed page edits both bands. Combines with every mod.",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "Digital Alchemy DSP",
